/* Traffic the websites received (2.6 accounting); older records say it was not recorded. */
// Owner decision 2.6: Low-impact's one-variant boundary is a non-error "Limited by profile" outcome, never a retry offer; a run with a real gap stays incomplete and also mentions it.
